<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Booking Confirmation</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f4f7f9;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            color: #333;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 20px auto;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 8px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
        }
        .header {
            background-color: #00509d; /* Deep Sea Blue */
            color: #ffffff;
            padding: 40px 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .header h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 28px;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }
        .content {
            padding: 30px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .user-greeting {
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #00509d;
        }
        .booking-box {
            background-color: #f0f4f8;
            border-left: 4px solid #00509d;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 25px 0;
        }
        .booking-details {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .label {
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #555;
        }
        .value {
            color: #000;
        }
        .btn-container {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 30px 0;
        }
        .button {
            background-color: #00a8cc;
            color: white;
            padding: 14px 25px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            font-weight: bold;
            display: inline-block;
        }
        .footer {
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #777;
            border-top: 1px solid #eeeeee;
        }
        .footer p {
            margin: 5px 0;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>⛵ Boat Sea</h1>
            <p>Your Voyage is Confirmed!</p>
        </div>

        <div class="content">
            <p class="user-greeting">Ahoy, <%= userName %>!</p>
            <p>Thank you for choosing <strong>Boat Sea</strong>. Your payment was successful, and your booking is now officially confirmed. Get ready for an incredible experience on the water!</p>

            <div class="booking-box">
                <div class="booking-details">
                    <span class="label">Booking Number:</span>
                    <span class="value">#<%= bookingNumber %></span>
                </div>
                <div class="booking-details">
                    <span class="label">Total Paid:</span>
                    <span class="value"><%= amount %> BDT</span>
                </div>
                <div class="booking-details">
                    <span class="label">Status:</span>
                    <span class="value" style="color: #28a745; font-weight: bold;">Confirmed & Paid</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <p>We have attached your official invoice to this email for your records. You can also view it online using the link below:</p>

            <div class="btn-container">
                <a href="<%= invoiceUrl %>" class="button">View Online Invoice</a>
            </div>

            <p><strong>What's Next?</strong><br>
            Please arrive at the dock at least 20 minutes before your scheduled departure. Don't forget to bring a valid ID and a copy of this confirmation (digital or printed).</p>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            <p>&copy; 2026 Boat Sea Adventures. All rights reserved.</p>
            <p>Dhaka, Bangladesh | Support: support@boatsea.com</p>
            <p>If you didn't make this booking, please contact us immediately.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>